Subject: Compile whole original AX with native SDK metadata
Upstream-base: a353c8f2dfb34eb08fecd725965a46ea629428e3

Retain all original AX initialization, task waits, callbacks, rings, voice
selection, control flow and arithmetic. Use canonical native SDK headers
and C fundamental declarations; retain complete callback/mail contexts
and native pointer-array strides. Replace the MWCC64-byte clear intrinsic
with its exact retail-supported zero-memory operation and express numeric
DSP zero without a C void-pointer NULL. Real DSP execution, bus-address
transport and initialization completion remain required native services;
this compiler patch supplies no fake hardware state or AX predecessor.

